# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo's working tree is the HOME DIRECTORY, and its origin is PUBLIC
# (yg674-dev/yueminggao.github.io-).
#
# A denylist is the wrong shape here: every new dotfile, credential store,
# download, and document that lands in ~ would need a rule written for it in
# advance, and a single miss publishes it. So this file ignores everything at
# the top level and opts projects in one at a time.
#
#   To start tracking a new project:   add   !/my-project/   under ALLOWED.
#   To see what is being ignored:      git status --ignored
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore every top-level entry by default.
/*

# --- repo metadata ---------------------------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# --- ALLOWED: tracked projects ---------------------------------------------
# (ai-persona-chat now lives in its own repo: yg674-dev/ai-persona-chat)
!/ai-travel-agent/
!/specs/
!/tiktok-gov-dashboard/

# --- exclusions inside allowed projects ------------------------------------
/ai-travel-agent/node_modules/
/ai-travel-agent/opentable-mcp/
/ai-travel-agent/opentable-mcp/node_modules/

# --- never track these, wherever they appear -------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/credentials
**/.DS_Store
**/~$*
**/*.log
